# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Josiah Roberts et al. (2024). Machine learned interatomic potentials for ternary carbides trained on the AFLOW database.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-024-01321-7  arXiv:2401.01852v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2401.01852v2 (sha256 d2634ae2276eefd7...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 128 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: moment tensor potentials at levels 10, 16 and 22 for
# four ternary carbide systems (C-Hf-Ta, C-Hf-Zr, C-Mo-W, C-Ta-Ti),
# trained on relaxation data from the AFLOW database and refined by
# active learning into a robust and an accurate potential with the PRAPs
# workflow. One actively learned robust-potential run per system and
# level is encoded with its settings. The per-system errors of Table II
# did not survive text extraction.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-roberts2024 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Roberts et al. (2024): machine learned interatomic potentials (MTPs) for ternary carbides trained on the AFLOW database" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-roberts2024 .

entity:article-roberts2024 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41524-024-01321-7> ;
    schema:datePublished "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "Machine learned interatomic potentials for ternary carbides trained on the AFLOW database" ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1359-5184> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3679-4191> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4185-6150> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3604-4761> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8497-0092> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3997-406X> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0009-0009-1618-4469> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0570-8238> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0738-867X> .

